      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Claire, a French-Korean teenager suffering from anorexia, favours drawing as a means of self-expression. Her graphic creations illustrate the search for identity of this child of migrants. Struggling with an impossible identification linked to her filiation, drawing represents for her a real object of mediation. It gives meaning to what dwells within her and constitutes the medium of her creativity."
      },
